  • theory_exact_mixture=False: Using parameter-space interpolation for CPI, which is NOT equivalent to policy-space mixture. The CPI improvement guarantee does not strictly apply. Set theory_exact_mixture=True for theory-exact behavior (but slower due to evaluating two networks).

